            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kirbie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent dip! My favorite to take to parties, always get asked for the receipe. I use fresh or frozen shirmp chopped fine (canned has a funny flavor to me). I triple the tabasco and add a bit more horshradish for adult crowds. I like mixing it together early in the day and then pop in the oven before the guest arrive,gives the flavors a chance to meld. Tortilla chips or even fritos work well or for a nicer presentation I use melba toast.",
            "datePublished": "2008-02-03T10:19:41.857Z"
